excerpt: "The $15 DIY hack for perfect traction on any ballroom floor."
affiliateIds:
  - suede-sheets
  - barge-cement
tags:
  - diy
  - footwear
  - budget
rating: 4.7
verdict: "Best Budget Hack"
priceCategory: "$"
